	(text "The Pocket's slot: pin 1 the cart rail (3.3 V with the Pocket on), 5 the core's TX (GBA /CS), 31 its RX\n(GBA /REQ), 32 ground; the rest left open, as Analogue's template leaves them.  Both buffers are LVC with\nIoff: the RX one on the device's +3V3, the TX one on the Pocket's own rail, so neither side back-feeds the\nother when it is off.  The 100k pull-downs hold an unpowered side low: the core hears a line only once it\nhas idled high for 1 ms."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 78.74 144.78 0)
		(effects
